   "id": "md-fence-and-inline",
   "path": "README.md",
   "text": "# T\n\nRun `bun install` once.\nNever call `cargo build` yourself.\nThe adapter runs `bazel test` for a test task.\n\n```bash\nbun repo run x\nrepo run y\n```\n\n```json\n{\"command\": \"bun x\"}\n```\n\n```\ncargo test -p a\n```\n",
   "findings": [
    [
     "bun",
     3
    ],
    [
     "bun",
     8
    ],
    [
     "cargo",
     17
    ]
   ]
  },
